---
description: Terraform, ops and local dev tooling (W1).
globs: infra/**,ops/**,dev/**,docker-compose.yml,Makefile
alwaysApply: false
---

See `infra/AGENTS.md`, `ops/AGENTS.md`, `dev/AGENTS.md`.
- Nothing in Google Cloud is created or changed by hand; Terraform only (use `alo-infra-change`).
- Secret values never go in Terraform or state. EU region. Least-privilege service accounts.
- Server settings change only via a `chore/infra-...` PR to `terraform.tfvars`.
- Never weaken the `ALO_ENV=local` / `K_SERVICE` refusal guard.
- Run `terraform fmt -check` and `terraform validate` before a PR.
